{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-27-1","title":"Psalms 27:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David sustains his faith by prayer.</p>\n<p>light. 18:28; 84:11; Job 29:3; Isa 2:5; 60:1-3,19,20; Mic 7:7,8; Mal 4:2 Joh 1:1-5,9; 8:12; Re 21:23; 22:5 salvation. 3:8; 18:2; 62:2,6; 68:19,20; 118:14,15,21; Ex 15:2; Isa 12:2; 51:6-8 Isa 61:10; Lu 2:30; 3:6; Re 7:10 strength. 18:1,2,46; 19:14; 28:7,8; 43:2; Isa 45:24; 2Co 12:9; Php 4:13 of whom. 11:1; 46:1,2; 56:2-4; 118:6; Mt 8:26; Ro 8:31; Heb 13:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-2","title":"Psalms 27:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>wicked. 3:7; 18:4; 22:16; 62:3,4 came upon. Heb. approached against. to. 14:4; 53:4; Job 19:22; 31:31 they. 18:38-42; 118:12; Isa 8:15; Joh 18:3-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-3","title":"Psalms 27:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>host. 3:6; 52:6; 2Ki 6:15-17; 2Ch 20:15; Php 1:28; 1Pe 3:14 war. 1Sa 28:15,16; Isa 41:11,12; 54:16,17; Ro 8:35-37; Re 2:10; 12:7-11 in. 2Co 5:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-4","title":"Psalms 27:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>One. 26:8; Lu 10:42; Php 3:13 seek. 8; Jer 29:13; Da 9:3; Mt 6:33; 7:7,8; Lu 11:9,10; 13:24; 18:1 Heb 11:6 dwell. 23:6; 26:6; 65:4; 84:4,10; 1Sa 1:11; Lu 2:37; 1Ti 5:5 behold. 50:2; 63:2; 90:17; Zec 9:9; 2Co 3:18; 4:6 beauty. or, delight. 63:2-5 enquire. 1Sa 22:10; 30:8; 2Sa 21:1; 1Ch 10:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-5","title":"Psalms 27:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>For in. 10:1; 32:6,7; 46:1; 50:15; 77:2; 91:15; 138:7; Pr 1:24-28; Isa 26:16 Jer 2:27,28 hide. 57:1; 83:3; 119:114; Pr 18:10; Isa 4:5,6; 26:20; 32:2; Mt 23:37 Col 3:3 secret. 31:20; 91:1; 2Ch 22:12; Ne 6:10,11 set me. 18:33; 40:2; 61:2; Hab 3:18,19; Mt 7:24,25; 16:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-6","title":"Psalms 27:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>And. 3:3; 110:7; Ge 40:13,20; 2Ki 25:27 above. 2Sa 7:9; 22:1,49; 1Ch 22:18 therefore. 22:22-25; 26:6,7; 43:3,4; 66:13-16; 107:22; 116:17-19; 2Ch 30:21-26 Jer 33:11; Heb 13:15; 1Pe 2:5 joy. Heb. shouting. 47:1; Ezr 3:11-13; Isa 12:6; Jer 31:7; Zep 3:14,15; Zec 9:9 Lu 19:37,38 I will. 21:1,13; 81:1; 95:1; 100:1,2; 138:5; Eph 5:19,20; Re 5:9; 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-7","title":"Psalms 27:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>4:1; 5:2; 130:2-4; 143:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-8","title":"Psalms 27:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>When, etc. or, My heart said unto thee, Let my face seek thyface, etc. Seek. 24:6; 105:4; Isa 45:19; 55:6,7; Ho 5:15 Thy. 63:1,2; 119:58; *marg: Jer 29:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-9","title":"Psalms 27:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Hide. 13:1; 44:24; 69:17; 102:2; 143:7; Isa 59:2 put. 51:11; Isa 50:1 thou. 71:5,6,17,18; 1Sa 7:12; Isa 46:3,4; 2Co 1:9,10; 2Ti 4:17,18 leave. 38:21; 119:121; 1Ch 28:9; Jer 32:40; Heb 13:5 O God. 24:5; 38:21,22; 88:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-10","title":"Psalms 27:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>When. 69:8; 2Sa 16:11; Isa 49:15; Mt 10:21,22,36 the Lord. Joh 9:35; 16:32; 2Ti 4:16 take me up. Heb. gather me. Isa 40:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-11","title":"Psalms 27:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Teach. 25:4,5,9,12; 86:11; 119:10; 143:8-10; Pr 2:6-9; Isa 30:20,21 a plain path. Heb. a way of plainness. 26:12; Pr 8:9; 15:19; Isa 35:8; Lu 3:4-6 mine enemies. Heb. those which observe me. 5:8; 54:5; *marg: 56:5,6; 64:6; Jer 20:10; Da 6:4,5; Lu 20:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-12","title":"Psalms 27:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>will. 31:8; 35:25; 38:16; 41:11; 140:8 false. 35:11; Ex 20:16; 1Sa 22:9,10; 26:19; 2Sa 16:7,8; Mt 26:59,60 Ac 6:11-13 breathe. 25:19; Ac 9:1; 26:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-13","title":"Psalms 27:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>fainted. 42:5; 56:3; 116:9-11; 2Co 4:1,8-14,16; Eph 2:8 in the. 52:5; 56:13; 142:5; Job 33:30; Isa 38:11,19; Jer 11:19; Eze 26:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-27-14","title":"Psalms 27:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":27,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":27,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Wait. 25:3,21; 31:24; 33:20; 62:1,5; 130:5; Ge 49:18; Isa 8:17; 25:9; 26:8 Isa 30:18; La 3:26; Hab 2:3; Lu 2:25,38; Ro 8:25 be. 31:24; Ac 28:15; 1Co 16:13; 2Ti 4:5-8 and. 138:3; Isa 40:31; 2Co 12:9,10; Eph 3:16; 6:10; Php 4:13; Col 1:11</p>"}]}